WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.335
Fellas! I'm getting married.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.172
It’s going to be just like old times.

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:09.259
Only better, right?

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:09.843
Better.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:12.429
Hollywood has come a-calling.

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:15.223
They want to make
“Unfinished Business” into a movie.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.393
Our carefree college days on full display.

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:18.977
I love it.

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:20.395
That book caused a lot of drama.

00:00:20.603 --> 00:00:21.771
Get your popcorn ready.

00:00:21.771 --> 00:00:22.605
Oooooo.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:25.150
You need a change of scenery.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.860
Come with us to Quentin’s wedding.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.153
It’s guaranteed to put 
a smile on your face.

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:35.493
You need to find something
you're passionate about.

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:36.995
Redefine your purpose!

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:40.331
I thought you found your purpose
with that perfume commercial.

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:43.084
Always...in my playbook.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.170
Always in my playbook.

00:00:45.962 --> 00:00:46.880
Aw, wait. I’m sorry.

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:50.341
We all make mistakes.

00:00:50.341 --> 00:00:52.093
And you've got to live
with the consequences.

00:00:52.093 --> 00:00:55.555
I know what it's like to be a tired,
overworked, exhausted mom.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:57.974
Wait, don't you have, like, three nannies?

00:00:57.974 --> 00:00:58.808
It takes a village.

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:14.741
Life doesn’t always go the way we expect.

00:01:15.116 --> 00:01:16.201
But if we're lucky,

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:17.786
we end up where we're supposed to.

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:24.459
We're actually really looking forward
to some husband and wife time.

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:25.335
Yes, we are.

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:26.878
Are you two going to have sex?

00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:28.046
What’s sex?

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:30.131
A really yummy dessert.

00:01:30.298 --> 00:01:31.508
Oooo, then can I have sex?

00:01:31.508 --> 00:01:32.092
Okay.

00:01:36.221 --> 00:01:37.430
Do you know who I want to play me?

00:01:37.847 --> 00:01:39.432
-Who? 
-Beyoncé.

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:41.142
Get your coins together, brother.

